  "final_span": "that lead to that outcome.\n\"In North America we rebalanced the business to benefit from cooling growth,\" according to management. Though this isn&apos;t rocket science, its manifestation has been particularly important. Alongside an 8% increase, North America accounted for 45% of the region\u2019s segment income; overall, North America contributed 60% of the income, compared to 27% from Europe, Middle East, and Africa \u2014 indicating a notable redistribution of income.\nNews also flowed from the China business sector. \"We have been making some good progress with the regional leadership team to proactively address nonprofitable projects, which we expect to result in lower working capital needs for the business,\" according to McDonald.\nJohnson Controls is the largest company that you may not be familiar with. You&apos;ve probably used its products, without knowing it, if for instance",
